   "note": "estimated - the brochure counts 38 LEDs: 16 cages x 2 lamps, the four status lamps and the two lamps of the ETH/BOOT jack. The status lamps are given the lit colours the photograph shows (USR yellow, FAULT red, PWR 2 and PWR 1 blue). Photograph 1324 shows the ACT and 10G lamps unlit. No held document says what a lamp shows; the quick guide has no LED table, so that is a gap."
  },
